{"type":"message","id":"e6de896d","parentId":"f7e54832","timestamp":"2026-03-28T23:54:18.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking about the MiniMax-M2.7 model's advantages and what it can do. I can answer based on my general knowledge of MiniMax models.","thinkingSignature":"1904860e8a0d14aa5cd26a47be5212850b1387aa910d0431e277eea3a8296948"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] MiniMax-M2.7 是国产大模型，主要特点：\n\n**优点：**\n- 🇨🇳 中文理解很强，语境、成语、谐音梗都能接住\n- 💰 成本相对低，响应速度快\n- 📝 逻辑推理、代码能力都不错\n- 🎯 适合日常对话、信息整理、写作这些任务\n\n**能干啥：**\n- 回答问题、聊天、写作文/文案\n- 写代码、调试bug\n- 分析图片（如果你发图给我）\n- 帮你操作飞书（查日历、管理多维表格等）\n- 搜索网页、整理信息\n- 等等……\n\n反正就是一个比较全能的小助手啦，有什么想试试的？🦐"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":190,"cacheRead":30693,"cacheWrite":544,"totalTokens":31554,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00022799999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018415799999999998,"cacheWrite":0.000204,"total":0.00231168}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774742053746,"responseId":"06179d26b4669d89259ae029458452ea"}}
