{"type":"message","id":"6029e048","parentId":"a6aa7010","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:10:28.490Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if the voice can only speak English. This suggests the TTS voice is in English, not Chinese. The user wants Chinese voice explanation. Let me check - the TTS tool should support Chinese. Maybe the default voice is English. Let me try specifying Chinese language in the TTS request.","thinkingSignature":"ba923a10e3469e60d23ea4b309eb9588745d235c31ee999aa8cfb9f6f17ff302"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 不是的！可以讲中文的 🎵\n\n刚才可能是语言设置的问题，我来重新生成一条中文语音试试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ygu6401qtxgq_1","name":"tts","arguments":{"text":"这道题考察的是青藏高原的气温特点。正确答案是A，海拔高，空气稀薄，大气保温作用弱。青藏高原平均海拔在4000米以上，海拔每升高100米，气温就会下降大约0.6度。所以虽然夏天太阳挺大的，但架不住它实在太高了呀。空气稀薄，保温效果不好，热量容易散失，所以夏季气温也比较低。选项B说离太阳太近，这个不对。C说常年被冰雪覆盖，冰雪是结果不是原因。D说纬度太高，也不对。关键是记住：青藏高原气温低是因为地形因素，也就是海拔高。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":240,"cacheRead":30385,"cacheWrite":12869,"totalTokens":43621,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.000288,"cacheRead":0.0018230999999999998,"cacheWrite":0.004825875,"total":0.006975075000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774743021330,"responseId":"0617a0edcfea8fe1952946276a0153dd"}}
