{"type":"message","id":"6e3391d9","parentId":"1f2d5297","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:11:24.402Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is still asking for Chinese explanation. It seems like the TTS I generated is not in Chinese, or maybe the user is hearing something different. Let me check if there's a language setting issue with the TTS tool. \n\nWait - the user said \"能不能改为中文讲解\" - they're still asking for Chinese. This might mean:\n1. The previous audio still wasn't Chinese\n2. Or they're asking for a different voice/setting\n\nLooking at the TTS tool, it just has a `text` parameter. There's no language option. The tool should handle Chinese text automatically.\n\nLet me try generating a new TTS with very clear Chinese text and see if it works. Maybe there's something wrong with the previous generation.","thinkingSignature":"c7969a42b5b27cd00d89cd3c083cdc106f4ed7e184116d974c4fd5f7d135dc52"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 刚发的那条就是中文讲解呀 🎵 \n\n你是不是听到的是英文？还是播放失败了？\n\n要不我再发一条，你告诉我是听到了但不是中文，还是根本播放不了？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":192,"cacheRead":43356,"cacheWrite":716,"totalTokens":44391,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0002304,"cacheRead":0.0026013599999999996,"cacheWrite":0.0002685,"total":0.0031383599999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774743077958,"responseId":"0617a1263d5220881fe3dea4107c1862"}}
