{"type":"message","id":"710203c2","parentId":"e7ee8e26","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:15:35.899Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! There's a `node-edge-tts` in the lark extension. Edge TTS is a Microsoft TTS service that supports Chinese. Let me check how it's configured.","thinkingSignature":"6b7d4e7bd9b76297aa71fa11505fda959ee264d69960b972cfc0c0f221df4431"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gpj5wscrjrjx_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/node_modules/node-edge-tts/README.md","limit":50}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16109,"output":92,"cacheRead":30385,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46586,"cost":{"input":0.0048327,"output":0.0001104,"cacheRead":0.0018230999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0067662}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774743333135,"responseId":"0617a225f3da35aa5f2471a25dea28a2"}}
{"type":"message","id":"979d016e","parentId":"710203c2","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:15:35.922Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_gpj5wscrjrjx_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# node-edge-tts\r\n\r\nnode-edge-tts is a module that utilizes Microsoft Edge's online TTS (Text-to-Speech) service on Node.js\r\n\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n\r\n```\r\nnpm install node-edge-tts\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Or you can directly use it in the command line.\r\n```\r\nnpx node-edge-tts -t 'Hello world'\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Command line usage\r\n```\r\nUsage: npx node-edge-tts [options]\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n      --help           Show help                                       [boolean]\r\n      --version        Show version number                             [boolean]\r\n  -t, --text           The text to be converted to speech    [string] [required]\r\n  -f, --filepath       The output file path   [string] [default: \"./output.mp3\"]\r\n  -v, --voice          The voice to be used\r\n                                        [string] [default: \"zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural\"]\r\n  -l, --lang           The language to be used       [string] [default: \"zh-CN\"]\r\n  -o, --outputFormat   The output format\r\n                           [string] [default: \"audio-24khz-48kbitrate-mono-mp3\"]\r\n      --pitch          The pitch of the voice      [string] [default: \"default\"]\r\n  -r, --rate           The rate of the voice       [string] [default: \"default\"]\r\n      --volume         The volume of the voice     [string] [default: \"default\"]\r\n  -s, --saveSubtitles  Whether to save subtitles      [boolean] [default: false]\r\n  -p, --proxy          example: http://localhost:7890                   [string]\r\n      --timeout        The timeout of the request      [number] [default: 10000]\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n  npx node-edge-tts -t 'Hello world' -f './output.mp3'\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n## Module usage\r\n\r\n```\r\nconst { EdgeTTS } = require('node-edge-tts')\r\n```\r\nor\r\n```\r\n\n[49 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774743335918}}
{"type":"message","id":"519e4351","parentId":"979d016e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:15:43.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The default voice is `zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural` which is Chinese. So the TTS should be generating Chinese audio by default.\n\nWait, maybe the TTS tool in openclaw is using a different provider (like minimax TTS) and that's why it's going to English? Let me check how the openclaw `tts` tool works.\n\nActually, looking at the system prompt, the `tts` tool description says \"Convert text to speech. Audio is delivered automatically from the tool result — reply with NO_REPLY after a successful call to avoid duplicate messages.\"\n\nSo the TTS tool should be using Edge TTS with Chinese voice by default. But the user says they're hearing English. Maybe the TTS is somehow detecting the content as English and using an English voice?\n\nLet me try calling the TTS tool with explicit Chinese text and see what happens. Or maybe there's a way to see what voice is being used.\n\nActually, let me just try using the edge-tts directly via exec to generate Chinese audio, then send it via message tool.","thinkingSignature":"b03a5cc5c8a1b230e40d616d6a5bd1122711ab8ea97917fcaf9f32313362eabf"},{"type":"text","text":"原来Edge TTS默认就是中文语音（zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural）！让我直接调用试试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fg2ntd1w9o8d_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/node_modules/node-edge-tts && node -e \"\nconst { EdgeTTS } = require('.');\nconst tts = new EdgeTTS();\ntts.ttsPromise({\n  text: '这道题考察的是青藏高原的气温特点。正确答案是A，海拔高，空气稀薄，大气保温作用弱。青藏高原平均海拔在4000米以上，海拔每升高100米，气温就会下降大约0.6度。',\n  voice: 'zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural',\n  output: '/tmp/openclaw/tts-chinese-test.mp3'\n}).then(() => console.log('done')).catch(e => console.error(e));\n\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":16661,"output":418,"cacheRead":30385,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47464,"cost":{"input":0.0049983,"output":0.0005015999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018230999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.007323}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774743335922,"responseId":"0617a2286c45f85c541c65c7caf76752"}}
