{"type":"message","id":"e46562a5","parentId":"f4884b24","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:16:18.495Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Sent! Now let me explain to the user what happened and what I did to fix it.","thinkingSignature":"63fc0108baceb39aa30652c845e2f756ad56479a14006da6526fefff99ce8f3d"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 抱歉搞了半天 😅\n\n之前TTS工具可能默认用了英文语音，所以听起来怪怪的。我直接调用了中文语音接口重新生成，这条应该是正宗中文讲解了 🎵\n\n听听看？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":18098,"output":68,"cacheRead":30385,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48551,"cost":{"input":0.0054294,"output":0.00008159999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018230999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0073341}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774743375446,"responseId":"0617a24fbd4a1f32c884c3131d8e09cc"}}
