{"type":"message","id":"066e911f","parentId":"9f105419","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:16:54.026Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user sent a thumbs up emoji, which means the Chinese voice audio worked! Great, they're happy with it.","thinkingSignature":"e1771548f9c82baba56fc9d14803ec95f053b1e7a80845cb257bbfc8b6af3463"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 🎉 成功了！\n\n以后地理老师讲答案都会用中文语音发送，女儿可以闭着眼听讲解了～\n\n要不要再来几道题练练？🌏"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":66,"cacheRead":30385,"cacheWrite":17627,"totalTokens":48205,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0000792,"cacheRead":0.0018230999999999998,"cacheWrite":0.0066101250000000005,"total":0.008550525}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774743408843,"responseId":"0617a271ff60a19cbd2c868725a96de0"}}
