{"type":"message","id":"04ab8f70","parentId":"386b50ea","timestamp":"2026-03-29T00:18:30.412Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user says \"不错，不过复盘下这个工作\" which means \"Good, but let's review/recap this work.\" They want to summarize what we've done with the geography tutor skill and the voice explanation feature.\n\nLet me summarize:\n1. Added voice explanation feature to geography tutor skill\n2. Fixed the TTS issue - discovered that the built-in tts tool was using English voice for Chinese text\n3. Found that we could directly use the node-edge-tts library with zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural voice for Chinese\n4. Successfully sent Chinese voice explanations via feishu\n\nBut there's an issue - the current workflow requires me to manually generate the audio via exec command and then send it via message tool. The built-in tts tool doesn't work well for Chinese.\n\nI should think about how to make this more automatic. The user is asking for a recap, so let me summarize what happened and what the current limitation is.","thinkingSignature":"5fa3276363eff1ee44e66101206835059251343b389934838685ba4b83b5374d"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 好的，来复盘一下 🌏\n\n**做了啥：**\n1. 在地理导师技能里加了\"语音讲解答案\"功能\n2. 女儿做题后，不仅给文字答案，还发语音讲解\n\n**遇到的问题：**\n- TTS工具内置会先把文字转音频，但它默认用英文语音，中文听起来就像老外说中文 😄\n- 需要手动调用 `node-edge-tts` 库，指定 `--voice zh-CN-XiaoyiNeural` 才能生成正宗中文语音\n\n**目前的工作流程（有点麻烦）：**\n```\n出题 → 用户回答 → 我手动用exec调用edge-tts生成中文mp3 → 用message工具发送\n```\n\n**可以优化的地方：**\n- 把TTS工具的语音默认调成中文（还没找到配置在哪）\n- 或者让技能更自动化，每次讲解自动生成+发送语音\n\n要我接下来研究一下怎么把TTS默认改成中文吗？这样以后就全自动了，不用每次手动搞～ 🎵"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":402,"cacheRead":48083,"cacheWrite":1073,"totalTokens":49685,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00048239999999999996,"cacheRead":0.0028849799999999997,"cacheWrite":0.000402375,"total":0.0038078549999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774743499841,"responseId":"0617a2ccd2f4fbe05f80