{"type":"message","id":"4b2abf42","parentId":"6417958b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:06:04.087Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I've finished configuring the TTS to use Chinese voice. I just restarted the gateway. Let me wait a moment and then test if the TTS now works with Chinese voice automatically.","thinkingSignature":"396f28068da1898c14a6ad01a40a8d67450f4e2b61e35597cc727e06159bdd80"},{"type":"text","text":"应该好了！刚才改成了中文语音配置，并重启了 Gateway 🎵\n\n来试试直接用 TTS 工具生成一条中文语音，不用手动调用了：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jgqc32zk9448_1","name":"tts","arguments":{"text":"这道题考察的是青藏高原的气温特点。正确答案是A，海拔高，空气稀薄，大气保温作用弱。青藏高原平均海拔在4000米以上，海拔每升高100米，气温就会下降大约0.6度。"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":143,"output":149,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":97528,"totalTokens":97820,"cost":{"input":0.0000429,"output":0.00017879999999999998,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.036573,"total":0.0367947}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774746356523,"responseId":"0617adf5ca4dd938d165f8e7fed75529"}}
