{"type":"message","id":"56cd7b84","parentId":"fae5898a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:06:09.084Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check if the audio was generated correctly and sent to the user.","thinkingSignature":"2ae11f816681417f55a063b16bb1f3ade4d14530fee7c4b00a4e1d25918652e8"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我刚发了一条中文 TTS 语音，试试能不能正常听到中文？\n\n如果可以的话，以后每次出题讲解答案都会自动用中文语音播放了，不用再手动搞了 🎵"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":61446,"output":63,"cacheRead":36393,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":97902,"cost":{"input":0.0184338,"output":0.0000756,"cacheRead":0.0021835799999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02069298}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774746365897,"responseId":"0617adfe81d0287c8d10eca60189c99f"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5fc74a92","parentId":"56cd7b84","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:06:46.801Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-29 09:06:46 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53b3fc976cb0c3089acd39f8d9a]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53b3fc976cb0c3089acd39f8d9a\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 09:06 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n还是发的文件地址，没有看到文件"}],"timestamp":1774746406796}}
{"type":"message","id":"0d73f7b3","parentId":"5fc74a92","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:06:59.420Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying that the TTS tool is still sending a file address, not an audio file they can play. Let me check what's happening.\n\nThe TTS tool result says \"Generated audio reply\" which means it generated audio. But the user is getting a file address rather than an audio message they can play.\n\nThis might be because:\n1. The audio is being delivered as a result of the tool call, but the message tool in Feishu is converting it to a file link\n2. Or the audio file is being saved to /tmp but not being sent properly\n\nLet me check how the TTS result is being sent to the user. The tool result content says \"Generated audio reply.\" - this is text, not the actual audio. The audio is supposed to be \"delivered automatically from the tool result\" according to the description.\n\nLooking at the tool code:\n```\nreturn {\n  content: [{\n    type: \"text\",\n    text: \"Generated audio reply.\"\n  }],\n  details: {\n    audioPath: result.audioPath,\n    provider: result.provider,\n    media: {\n      mediaUrl: result.audioPath,\n      ...result.voiceCompatible ? { audioAsVoice: true } : {}\n    }\n  }\n};\n```\n\nSo the audio path is returned in `details.media.mediaUrl`. But this doesn't automatically send the audio to the user - it just includes it in the tool result.\n\nFor Feishu, when the `tts` tool is called, the system should be sending the audio. But it seems like it's only sending the text \"Generated audio reply.\" instead.\n\nThis might be a limitation of the Feishu channel integration with the TTS tool. The `asVoice` flag in the message tool earlier worked when we manually sent the file. \n\nI think the issue is that the TTS tool isn't properly integrated with Feishu's voice messaging - it's just returning the file path as text rather than triggering the voice message send. The earlier workaround of using `message` with `asVoice: true` worked because that directly sent the audio file, whereas the TTS tool result seems to be missing that automatic media handling for Feishu.","thinkingSignature":"20ad409a0d84e04ae5eca4cf7146e262462acd169f404736a665823e5ac5f3fa"},{"type":"text","text":"啊抱歉，工具返回的只是文字\"Generated audio reply\"，音频并没有自动发给你 😔\n\nTTS工具在飞书上似乎不能直接转成语音消息自动发送。我来手动发：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bqtczwvrrfij_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -lt /tmp/openclaw/tts-* 2>/dev/null | head -3"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":0,"output":528,"cacheRead":98113,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":98641,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0.0006336,"cacheRead":0.0058867799999999994,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.006520379999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774746406808,"responseId":"0617ae27b3893a6c89b0158c2188aefd"}}
