{"type":"message","id":"09534ad0","parentId":"d2e8e283","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:07:12.177Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The new TTS call didn't create a file in /tmp. Maybe the TTS tool saves to a different location when called as a tool. Let me check the openclaw logs or find where the tts tool saves its output.\n\nActually, looking at the code earlier:\n```javascript\nasync function textToSpeech(params) {\n\tconst synthesis = await synthesizeSpeech(params);\n\tif (!synthesis.success || !synthesis.audioBuffer || !synthesis.fileExtension) return buildTtsFailureResult([synthesis.error ?? \"TTS conversion failed\"]);\n\tconst tempRoot = resolvePreferredOpenClawTmpDir();\n\tmkdirSync(tempRoot, { recursive: true, mode: 448 });\n\tconst tempDir = mkdtempSync(path.join(tempRoot, \"tts-\"));\n\n\n```\n\nThe function writes the synthesized audio to a temp file using the path from `synthesis.audioBuffer` and then schedules cleanup. So the audio gets saved to a temporary directory that should be under `/tmp/openclaw/`, but I'm not seeing the file there from the recent call. Maybe the cleanup is happening too quickly, or the tool is saving to a different location than I expect.\n\nLet me just regenerate the audio directly using the exec approach since that's working more reliably for sending to the user.","thinkingSignature":"106d93ec6a6544445e8f67a8da148266215b228f607614e3514260d81a8020f0"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_1aj8n9upd8qv_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd ~/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-lark/node_modules/node-edge-tts && node -e \"\nconst { EdgeTTS } = require('.');\nconst tts = new EdgeTTS();\ntts.ttsPromise(\n  '这道题考察的是青藏高原的气温特点。正确答案是A，海拔高，空气稀薄，大气保温作用弱。青藏高原平均海拔在4000米以上，海拔每升高100米，气温就会下降大约0.6度。',\n  '/tmp/openclaw/tts-new.mp3'\n).then(() => console.log('done')).catch(e => console.error(e));\n\" 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":62444,"output":423,"cacheRead":36393,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99260,"cost":{"input":0.0187332,"output":0.0005076,"cacheRead":0.0021835799999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02142438}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774746422803,"responseId":"0617ae3792998720caf514602afd6fe1"}}
