{"type":"message","id":"3e71c81d","parentId":"f7ff6748","timestamp":"2026-03-29T01:07:23.803Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the message was sent successfully. Let me tell the user to check this audio.","thinkingSignature":"27667be649f8f063ae0c41fc6f5ee71c3e63aa2107d50c6f0561e9db404f7e7d"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 重新发了一条，这次应该是可以播放的语音 🎵\n\n不过说实话，TTS工具和飞书的集成有点问题——它生成音频但不自动发语音消息。以后的解决方案是：\n1. 我生成音频文件\n2. 用 message 工具的 `asVoice` 参数发送\n\n女儿听讲解的时候，我就手动发一下。抱歉带来不便 😅"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":63063,"output":99,"cacheRead":36393,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":99555,"cost":{"input":0.0189189,"output":0.0001188,"cacheRead":0.0021835799999999996,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02122128}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774746439328,"responseId":"0617ae47cbcc8a7ab5874944f9319d9d"}}
